<section class="max-w-[1240px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 lg:py-20 border-b border-[var(--border)]" id="faq">
<div class="max-w-2xl mb-10">
<div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
<span class="text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--brand-primary)]">Before you get started</span>
</div>
<h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-[var(--ink)] mb-3 tracking-tight">
          Frequently asked questions
        </h2>
<p class="text-base text-[var(--muted)]">Learn about early access, account approval, mobile releases, and order tracking.</p>
</div>

<div class="space-y-3.5 max-w-4xl">

<details class="bg-[var(--surface)] border border-[var(--border)] rounded-lg p-5" open><summary class="text-sm font-bold text-[var(--ink)] mb-2">What is AISLEY?</summary><p class="text-base sm:text-base text-[var(--muted)] leading-relaxed">AISLEY is a Philippine multi-vendor marketplace connecting buyers, independent sellers, logistics organizations, and couriers.</p></details>

<details class="bg-[var(--surface)] border border-[var(--border)] rounded-lg p-5" open><summary class="text-sm font-bold text-[var(--ink)] mb-2">Is AISLEY available everywhere?</summary><p class="text-base sm:text-base text-[var(--muted)] leading-relaxed">AISLEY is in early access. Available products and delivery options depend on participating shops and operational coverage. Review the options presented at checkout.</p></details>

<details class="bg-[var(--surface)] border border-[var(--border)] rounded-lg p-5" open><summary class="text-sm font-bold text-[var(--ink)] mb-2">How does Admin approval work for sellers and logistics hubs?</summary><p class="text-base sm:text-base text-[var(--muted)] leading-relaxed">Seller and Logistics accounts require Admin approval. Couriers require approval by their associated Logistics organization.</p></details>

<details class="bg-[var(--surface)] border border-[var(--border)] rounded-lg p-5" open><summary class="text-sm font-bold text-[var(--ink)] mb-2">Where can I get the mobile apps?</summary><p class="text-base sm:text-base text-[var(--muted)] leading-relaxed">The Buyer and Rider links open their respective GitHub Releases pages. Review the release notes and available packages there.</p></details>

<details class="bg-[var(--surface)] border border-[var(--border)] rounded-lg p-5" open><summary class="text-sm font-bold text-[var(--ink)] mb-2">Does tracking show a live courier location?</summary><p class="text-base sm:text-base text-[var(--muted)] leading-relaxed">Order tracking follows recorded shipment milestones. Live courier GPS tracking is not promised.</p></details>
</div>
<div class="section-action"><a class="primary-action" href="https://aisley.app" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Start shopping <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div>
</section>
